# nopCommerce conventions

- Prefer a plugin under `src/Plugins/` over editing `Nop.Core`, `Nop.Data`, `Nop.Services`, or MVC controllers. Core edits are a last resort.
- Storefront injections go through widget zones in `PublicWidgetZones` (for example `CheckoutCompletedTop`). Do not patch `CheckoutController` to add HTML.
- All service and controller methods are async. Do not add new sync service APIs.
- Match neighboring code: `BasePlugin`, `plugin.json`, output to `Presentation/Nop.Web/Plugins/{FolderName}/`.
- Do not commit `App_Data/appsettings.json`, connection strings, or secrets.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD — banner baked into checkout
public async Task<IActionResult> Completed(int? orderId) { /* add ViewBag.Banner */ }

// ✅ GOOD — IWidgetPlugin registered on CheckoutCompletedTop
public Task<IList<string>> GetWidgetZonesAsync() =>
    Task.FromResult<IList<string>>(new List<string> { PublicWidgetZones.CheckoutCompletedTop });
```
